- data/manual/west_bank_display_boundary_replacements.geojson

Canonical geography packages and row-level assignment fields published under
`public-data/` remain on the open-data side. Web-only polygon unions,
representative display groups, fallback boundaries, masks, marker placement,
party colors, styles, and map modes remain on the protected product side.

